      "writtenOn": "2017-10-25T14:11:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why are we deleting the logical port on a disable? Shouldn\u0027t this only be done on a delete of the ONU?",
      "revId": "3488e7e16f951a50f0213f8f8decdbaffbb69c36",
      "serverId": "2a2bfe1b-c5c2-48ed-9ac8-16438ab24388",
