        "id": 1000099
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-10-26T18:05:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Peter,\nWhen you say generation of port number from ONOS, are you talking about logical port number?\nAgree that if ONOS is not sending flow while disable/enable, we need to rise a bug and track it. For now my suggestion is to take this changes as workaround and not to store any information in adapter because it may affect HA cases.",
      "parentUuid": "9a5c5d37_d799886f",
      "revId": "3488e7e16f951a50f0213f8f8decdbaffbb69c36",
      "serverId": "2a2bfe1b-c5c2-48ed-9ac8-16438ab24388",
      "unresolved": false
